Description:

The vnd.cmu.visibleUsers event parameter now lists the users who can read the
mailbox.  It was always empty before, so it never appeared in events.


Documentation:

None beyond its name in the list of event_extra_params values.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

Notification consumers that read vnd.cmu.visibleUsers will start receiving
it on mailbox events.


GitHub issue:

None.
